      "sentence": "Multi-parameter soil sensor calibration and filtering for Arduino & ESP32.",
      "paragraph": "Transport-agnostic library for RS485 Modbus 8-in-1 soil sensors with per-channel adaptive Kalman filtering, multi-point segmented linear interpolation calibration, and dual calibration methods (live field + offline batch CSV). Supports Temperature, Moisture, EC, pH, Nitrogen, Phosphorus, Kalium, and Fertility channels. Keywords: soil, calibration, Modbus, multi-point, offline, batch, RS485. Cross-platform persistent storage: ESP32 (Preferences/NVS) and AVR (EEPROM).",
